      "bbox": [
        191,
        1283,
        1555,
        1736
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This memorandum contains information and instructions in connection with the handling of communications which are addressed to the Mayor and referred to you and other agencies for appropriate attention. Communications include, in addition to letters and telegrams addressed to the Mayor at City Hall, Gracie Mansion and Box 100, the currently used form of memorandum applicable to communications made by telephone or personal visits.",
      "logprob_stats": {
